<https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_underexploration> a s:Hypothesis ; s:content "Limited sampling may leave useful alternatives unexplored." ; s:scope "MAB:ontology_mab" ; s:timestamp "2026-10-15T15:19:23.947459+00:00" ; s:provenance "bounded-models-and-provisional-assumptions" ; s:model_version "models-0.1" ; s:status "inferred" ; s:status "source-dependent" ; s:status "requires-verification" ; s:status "probable" ; s:status "contested" ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_1> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_2> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_3> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_4> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_5> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_6> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_7> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_8> ; s:dependsOn <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_environment> ; s:revises <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_23_underexploration> ; s:confidence "0.72"^^xsd:double ; s:confidenceInterpretation "Posterior under provisional hand-written CPTs; not a diagnosis or calibrated intervention effect." ; s:alternative "Persistence may be justified by rewards or an intentional strategy." ; s:alternative "The cost of exploration depends on the remaining horizon." ; s:revisionCondition "Sampling additional alternatives weakens this interpretation." ; s:revisionCondition "An attributed participant explanation can contest this account." .
<https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_premature_exploitation> a s:Hypothesis ; s:content "Persistence may merit reconsideration after declining feedback." ; s:scope "MAB:ontology_mab" ; s:timestamp "2026-10-15T15:19:23.947459+00:00" ; s:provenance "bounded-models-and-provisional-assumptions" ; s:model_version "models-0.1" ; s:status "inferred" ; s:status "source-dependent" ; s:status "requires-verification" ; s:status "low-confidence" ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_1> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_2> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_3> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_4> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_5> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_6> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_7> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_8> ; s:dependsOn <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_environment> ; s:revises <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_23_premature_exploitation> ; s:confidence "0.08"^^xsd:double ; s:confidenceInterpretation "Posterior under provisional hand-written CPTs; not a diagnosis or calibrated intervention effect." ; s:alternative "Noisy rewards can explain the apparent decline." ; s:alternative "Estimated values may not match the participant’s own beliefs." ; s:revisionCondition "A recovered reward pattern weakens change evidence." ; s:revisionCondition "Switching or an explicit rationale revises the persistence interpretation." .
<https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_feedback_overweighting> a s:Hypothesis ; s:content "Recent switching after losses may over-weight individual outcomes." ; s:scope "MAB:ontology_mab" ; s:timestamp "2026-10-15T15:19:23.947459+00:00" ; s:provenance "bounded-models-and-provisional-assumptions" ; s:model_version "models-0.1" ; s:status "inferred" ; s:status "source-dependent" ; s:status "requires-verification" ; s:status "low-confidence" ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_1> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_2> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_3> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_4> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_5> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_6> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_7> ; s:supportedBy <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_trial_8> ; s:dependsOn <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_25_environment> ; s:revises <https://example.org/socratic/ontology_mab_event_23_feedback_overweighting> ; s:confidence "0.08"^^xsd:double ; s:confidenceInterpretation "Posterior under provisional hand-written CPTs; not a diagnosis or calibrated intervention effect." ; s:alternative "Switching may be planned exploration." ; s:alternative "Several outcomes may contain valid evidence of change." ; s:revisionCondition "Sustained sampling or an explanation of planned exploration weakens this interpretation." .
